      "description": "This trainer is inspired by the excellent FLiNG trainer for the PC version of Cyberpunk 2077. Made and tested on Firmware 9.00. BE SURE TO READ ALL the comments where available. It`s recommended to enable cheats such as Stats, Money, Inventory quantities, on demand and disable them when not needed. Most of them are needed to modify stats only once or a few times at most. Enjoy! ;-)",
