      "description": "Cheats for ME-1 ARE ONLY for Mass Effect 1, not for ME2 or ME3 and vice versa, so only enable the cheats for the game that you are playing and only enable AFTER the game is launched, not on the LAUNCHER MENU (game selection) before you launch the game of your choice! Watch Out! If you enable ME-2 cheats on another game like Mass Effect 3, for example, they will not work and it is likely the game will crash. Also - DISABLE ANY ACTIVE CHEAT BEFORE GOING BACK TO THE LAUNCHER MENU OR SWITCHING BETWEEN MASS EFFECT GAMES, OTHERWISE THE GAME MAY CRASH. This trainer was made and tested on PS4 Firmware 9.00, but should also work on other firmwares.",
