      "description": "BE SURE TO READ ALL the comments where available. As a rule of thumb, ALWAYS enable cheats that are needed and disable when they are not. OTU = One time use cheat. Partially ported from TLH v01.22 PS4 trainer and FLiNG PC trainer. For an even more advanced Fallout-4 trainer, check out my MultiTrainer2 ShnExt trainer. Made and tested on PS4 Firmware 9.00. Enjoy! ;-)",
