      "description": "Gives the player a complete invincibility to all types of damages (might still get temporary blurred vision rarely, but no damage). When enabling this option, no need to enable Inf_HP, Inf_AP, No_Radiation and Infinite Power Armor Core Power.",
      "type": "checkbox",
