    {
      "name": "---One Hit Kill (Req. MS)",
      "description": "Note that you may get instantly killed by an explotion you initiated yourself etc., for example - if you shoot and explode a car while standing nearby and get hit by your own initiated blast - you will be instantly killed with this cheat enabled.",
