    {
      "name": "No Weapon Spin-up",
      "description": "This cheat disables the spin-up and cool-down delays of weapons like the mini-gun. They can be then used to fire instantly. The Small-Arms Fully-Automatic cheat already contains this functionality, so you may want to disable this cheat if you enabled the other one.",
