    {
      "name": "---One Hit Kill (requires MC)",
      "description": "Using OHK on specific bosses, such as the first Goblin in Hogsmeade will cause progression issues. Also, deactive the cheat when practicing in Hogwarts, especially with dummies (eg. The Chinese chomping cabbage practice) as you may not be able to complete the training. If you get stuck after killing an enemy, disable OHK and reload the last save to complete the fight without it, then you may re-activate the cheat.",
