    {
      "name": "Teleport To Map Waypoint",
      "description": "Enable Infinite HP cheat as a precaution. After being teleported, wait a few seconds for rendering to complete. When its done, press X + DPAD DOWN to continue. If you get teleported BELOW THE MAP after the game completes rendering, first press X + DPAD UP to lift you above the map and then press X + DPAD DOWN to continue. If for any reason you end up falling infinitely below the map, exit the game and re-launch it. AVOID teleporting yourself to places that are still locked, which you are not suppose to be able to reach yet, as this may cause game progession issue or other issues. DOESNT WORK IN FLY MODE.",
